<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Marché secondaire</title>
<style>body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#f1f5f9;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:560px;margin:40px auto;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.07)}.header{background:#1A2E35;padding:32px 40px;text-align:center}.logo{color:#FFB52E;font-size:26px;font-weight:800}.body{padding:40px}.h1{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#1A2E35;margin:0 0 12px}.p{font-size:15px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 20px}.card{background:#f8fafc;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:24px}.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9}.row:last-child{border:none}.label{font-size:13px;color:#64748b}.value{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1A2E35}.btn{display:block;width:fit-content;margin:0 auto;background:#FFB52E;color:#1A2E35;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none}.note{font-size:13px;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center}.footer{background:#f8fafc;padding:20px 40px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8}</style></head>
<body><div class="wrap">
  <div class="header"><div class="logo">BeOwn</div></div>
  <div class="body">
    <p class="h1">Nouvelle annonce disponible</p>
    <p class="p">Bonjour {{prenom}}, des fractions sont disponibles sur le marché secondaire pour un projet que vous suivez.</p>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="row"><span class="label">Projet</span><span class="value">{{titre}}</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="label">Fractions disponibles</span><span class="value">{{nbFractions}}</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="label">Prix par fraction</span><span class="value">{{prix}}</span></div>
    </div>
    <a href="{{appUrl}}" class="btn">Voir l'annonce</a>
    {{#if unsubscribeUrl}}<p class="note"><a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}" style="color:#94a3b8">Se désinscrire des annonces</a></p>{{/if}}
  </div>
  <div class="footer">© BeOwn — Investissement immobilier fractionné</div>
</div></body></html>
